EnergyCommunity.user.adminApp

Scope & Responsibilities:
- Encapsulates business logic for administrative and community management operations.
- Handles administrative workflows: member provisioning, asset onboarding, hardware constraint configurations, and community energy policy/tariff oversight.
- Audits system-wide energy metrics, historical activity, and operational alerts.

Component Boundaries & Visibility:
- VISIBILITY: CLIENT APPLICATION.
- Boundary Rule: Acts as an external consumer of the backend, communicating strictly through administrative contracts exposed by core.api. Has no direct access to core internal data stores or algorithms.
